   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Invitations and proposals",
   "texto": [
    "To propose a plan to friends we use «Zullen we... gaan?» (Are we going to...?): «Zullen we vanavond naar de film gaan?» (Are we going to the movies tonight?). To express enthusiasm: «Leuk!» (Great! / How good!). To invite you to come: «Kom je mee?» (Are you coming? / are you coming with me?). To accept with enthusiasm: «Ja, graag!» (Yes, delighted!). To apologize if you can't: «Sorry, ik kan niet» (I'm sorry, I can't)."
   ]
